Test geometries and expectations in this directory.

---

manifest.tsv — single source of truth for CI corpus expectations
(Schoenflies label, group order, symmetry number, analysis tolerance).

Rows marked "agree" matched both PySCF and Psi4 when the local (gitignored)
helpers in tests/make_corpus.py were last run, and every molsymm operation
was verified (distinct, orthogonal, closed, atom-permuting). Rows marked
"operations" keep a higher molsymm assignment only when those operation
checks pass and each present oracle label is a real subgroup of the assigned
group. Psi4 and PySCF are developer-only checks; they are not CTest targets
or library dependencies.

