iqmol/ — fragment XYZ files from IQmol by Andrew Gilbert:

  https://github.com/nutjunkie/IQmol/tree/master/share/fragments

Pinned commit: a3a60efabfb95f67bee5e3cb4f697d591a4e9b5f

Distributed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The full license text
is in iqmol/LICENSE (copied from upstream). Vendored as test inputs only; not
linked into the library.

Selected geometries (and anion-pi.xyz) were projected onto their manifest
target group via `tests/make_corpus.py --symmetrize` (Cyclopropane→D3h,
Ethane→D3d). XYZ comments note the projection; re-run that flag (or
`--audit-only` with oracles) to refresh.

